build/
# Source dir conflicting with the generic `build/` ignore — `src/build/` is
# the OpenCorvus build *agent* (post phase-3 of the isomorphic-agent
# refactor), not a build-output directory.
!packages/opencorvus/src/build/
# Repository Expert Squad authoring packages are tracked inputs. Runtime
# installations remain under the ignored `.opencorvus/` project root.
!expert-squads/
